<h1 class="page-title">Social Media Production</h1>
<p class="standfirst">Content and strategy that find an artist the audience who'll love their music.</p>

<h2>Wes Coeur</h2>
<p>I help Melbourne artist <a href="https://open.spotify.com/artist/4zjTgLNIPksuxMXCKClne9">Wes Coeur</a> produce his social media content and plan the strategy behind it. Together we've grown his Instagram from 500 to 5,000 followers and his TikTok from nothing to 3,400, with some of his videos passing a million views on TikTok and Instagram.</p>
<p>Our strategy is to let Wes be himself. His videos are about the things he genuinely cares about, so the audience they find shares his interests, and they're the people most likely to love his music: R&amp;B, soul and electro-pop that owes as much to Prince's romance as to Tyler, the Creator's playful weirdness. (I also produce and mix his music: see <a href="/interests/music/">Music</a>.)</p>

